// What guards say (NPCS.md, *Barks*): `when` near (a player coming by, the default), click (clicked
// with nothing to offer) or hit; `moods` to say it only in those. `{call:brother}` names the one
// it calls its brother, and only one who has one says it.
{
  lines: [
    "Move along.",
    "Keep your blade sheathed in town.",
    { text: "All quiet. Too quiet.", moods: ["nervous"] },
    { text: "Trouble?", when: "click" },
    { text: "To arms!", when: "hit" },
  ],
}
